	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bill: I look after the Storage\nSystem’s regional link.\rBoxes sync fine inside Johto, but\nanything crossing to another region\fgets stuck in the queue for days.\rSomething is clogging the line\nbetween regions... I’ll find it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you collect Pokémon?\nMy son Bill minds the Storage network.\rHe’s been up all night lately--\ntransfers to the other regions\fkeep stalling on him.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whatever happens, it makes me happy\nto see my own son.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My big brother Bill keeps the\nStorage System linked up across\fregions.\rHe says the line to the other\nregions has gone all laggy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Are you a Trainer?\rI’ve got a useful phone number\nfor you. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Bill\nin the Pokégear!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My brother keeps the Storage\nnetwork running.\rI was going to give you Bill’s number...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When you call my brother, he can tell\nyou about the PC Boxes where you\fstore your Pokémon!</language>
	</row>
</body>
